<title>UK: Triplex says Cook to add 1.5 mln stg profit.</title>
<headline>Triplex says Cook to add 1.5 mln stg profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triplex Lloyd Plc said on Friday that its proposed acquisition of William Cook should add some 1.5 million stg to profits on an annualised basis.</p>
<p>This will came from the ability to generate opportunities from sales and marketing, particularly in the petrochemical markets, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Earlier, Triplex said it is offering around 57.7 million stg for Cook in a cash and paper.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
